---
import Shell from '../../layouts/Shell.astro';
import HowItWorks from '../../components/HowItWorks.astro';
import Honorific from '../../components/Honorific.astro';
import { packs } from '../../data/content.json';
---
<Shell title="Which came first?">
  <section class="intro"><h1>Which came first?</h1> <p>Put four events from the Prophet's life <Honorific /> in order.</p></section>
  <section class="panel bottom-gap"><div class="panel-body filters"><label class="field">Choose a challenge<select id="pack-select">{packs.map(p=><option value={p.id}>Challenge {p.number} · {p.title}</option>)}</select></label> <label class="check"><input id="remember" type="checkbox"/> Remember this challenge for 30 days</label> <button class="button secondary" id="next-pack">Next challenge <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button> <button class="text-button" id="restart">Restart</button></div></section>
  <div class="workspace"><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><h2 id="challenge-title">Arrange the events</h2> <span class="pill">Earliest → latest</span></div> <div class="panel-body"><ol class="event-order" id="order"></ol><p id="challenge-feedback" role="status">Use the up and down buttons. Source clues are available on every card.</p><p class="micro"><a class="feedback-link" href="#site-feedback" data-open-feedback>Report an error <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></p><div class="actions"><button class="button" id="check">Check order</button> <button class="button secondary" id="hint">Reveal earliest event</button> <button class="text-button" id="reveal">Reveal sequence</button></div> <div class="actions top-gap"><span class="micro" id="stats"></span><button class="text-button" id="share">Copy challenge link</button></div></div></section> <aside class="sidebar"><HowItWorks><h3>Sequence before precision</h3><p>Only the broad event order is scored. Conventional dates are approximate, and a report that supports an event may not supply its displayed CE year.</p><p>More than one event may share a year. Every event here is also on the <a href="/">timeline</a>.</p><p><a href="/sources/">Read the methodology <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></p></HowItWorks></aside></div>
  <section id="answer" class="top-gap" aria-live="polite"></section>
  <div id="session-end"></div>
  <noscript><p class="noscript">The ordering game needs JavaScript. You can read every event and its sources on the timeline.</p></noscript>
</Shell>
<script>import '../../lib/challenge-app';</script>
